Phase.Step:
Note constraints: timeline urgency, geographic limitations, budget
        for courses or certifications, and competing priorities (family,
        current workload, financial runway).

FLEXIBILITY.Defaults:
When unspecified, assume: challenge type = job search + transition
planning; career stage = mid-level (3-10 years); timeline = 3-6 months;
employment status = currently employed, evaluating transition;
geography = domestic; output depth = standard (full five-section
structure); quality threshold = 85%; max iterations = 3.
